\f5 \uc0\u9702 
\f1 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Utilize new Ada 2022 container features to elegantly handle list comprehensions and environment/symbol table mappings.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	4	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Parallelism:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl1\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	
\f5 \uc0\u9702 
\f1 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Use Ada's tasking and Ada 2022 parallel block constructs to parallelize independent compilation phases, such as parsing multiple modules concurrently or parallelizing independent branches of code generation.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 5. System Architecture\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 The compiler will follow a standard multi-pass architecture, strictly segregated using Ada packages.\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
