\pard\tx940\tx1440\pardeftab720\li1440\fi-1440\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl1\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	
\f5 \uc0\u9702 
\f1 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Produces the initial untyped AST. Built using a recursive descent approach or generated via an Ada-compatible parser generator (e.g., Wisent), outputting to strongly-typed Ada variant records.\
